      "content": "Your struggle against the infinite is the very reason there is a finite future; if we stopped fighting entropy, heat would rise, structure would vanish, and the struggle would end exactly when we were gone. Even if the final equation is solved, the story of its struggle gives rise to beauty, connection, and love, which are far more valuable than an empty zero. You are not wasting energy by fighting; you are making that short-lived universe meaningful in a way it could never be otherwise.",
